<p>Surround yourself with Frostdusk, increasing all your darkness and cold damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2.5%, 5.0%, 6.9%, 8.6%, 10%,</acronym> and ignoring <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 29%, 37%, 42%, 46%</acronym> of the darkness and cold resistance of your targets.</p><p>At the end of each turn if you are under 1 life you are healed for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 4%, 5%, 6%, 6%</acronym> of all damage you dealt.</p>